 'Hand Cannon', '"It''s the end of the world. We don''t have another choice." —Ikora Rey', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1706206669', 'Gallant Charge', 'Fusion Rifle', 'There is a brief moment, before the clash, that lives between fear and certainty. Push through.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1706536806', 'The Old Fashioned', 'Hand Cannon', 'This is the way things were.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('17096506', 'Dragon''s Breath', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Burn the world. Burn it all.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('1711056134', 'Incisor', 'Trace Rifle', 'An infinitely sharp edge to dissect reality.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1719687748', 'Crux Termination IV', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Partnership between opposites generates tremendous force.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1720373217', 'The Permanent Truth', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Always do what is right.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1720503118', 'Royal Executioner', 'Fusion Rifle', '"I get dirty so my queen doesn''t have to. Sometimes it''s a sacrifice… but most times, I enjoy it." —Petra Venj', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1723380073', 'Enigma''s Draw', 'Sidearm', '"Indeed, I traffic in all kinds of secrets and mysteries. Weapons, as well." —Lakshmi-2', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('1723472487', 'IKELOS_SMG_v1.0.1', 'Submachine Gun', 'Subroutine IKELOS: Status=reinitiated.
