ite the Breakers'' treachery, Her Majesty still stands.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('2045811635', 'Imperative', 'Scout Rifle', '"We must stop the weavers before they seal the Garden and begin to summon back its heart." —Ikora Rey', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('204878059', 'Malfeasance', 'Hand Cannon', '"Nothing kills a Guardian faster than another Guardian." —The Drifter', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('2050789284', 'Stars in Shadow', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Little is known about the early days of the Collapse. Signals vanished upon the arrival of the Darkness.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('205225492', 'Hung Jury SR4', 'Scout Rifle', 'A Scout Rifle, modified by Dead Orbit''s superb technicians and specialists.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2059255495', 'Eye of Sol (Adept)', 'Sniper Rifle', '"The sun took my sight; thus, the sun became my eyes." —Parables of the Allspring', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2059741649', 'New Pacific Epitaph', 'Grenade Launcher', '"This isn''t happening. This isn''t happening. This isn''t happening."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2060863616', 'Salvager''s Salvo', 'Grenade Launcher', 'The only way out is through.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2063217087', 'Pre Astyanax IV (Adept)', 'Combat Bow', 'The lord of the city grants the blessing of precision.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2065081837', 'Uzume RR4', 'Sniper Rifle', 'With the Uzume RR4 on your side, the Darkness doesn''t stand a chance.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2066434718', 'Canis Major', 'Grenade Launcher', '"The stars roar with violent destruction. Channel their astral rage." —Ylaia, Awoken Techeun', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('2069224589', 'One Thousand Voices', 'Fusion Rifle', 'I can be anyone you wish, o