Ill omens. Stay awake.', '1498876634', '2395677314', 'Uncommon', '3', null), ('3366545721', 'Bequest', 'Sword', 'A single word etched on the guard: "Lusia-1."', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3369545945', 'Temporal Clause', 'Machine Gun', 'the future narrows narrows narrows narrows', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3371017761', 'Conditional Finality', 'Shotgun', 'You will dream of me… I will never leave you…', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3371413056', 'Death''s Razor', 'Sword', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3371413057', 'Goldtusk', 'Sword', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3371413059', 'Throne-Cleaver', 'Sword', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('337578911', 'Vision of Confluence (Timelost)', 'Scout Rifle', 'In the abyss of time, all the lines converge… upon you.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3376406418', 'Right Side of Wrong', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Where do you stand?', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('337893613', 'Qua Vinctus IV', 'Machine Gun', 'You are a fetter for your enemies.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3380742308', 'Alone as a god', 'Sniper Rifle', 'I am the perfect loving god, and all will tremble to know me.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3381450498', 'Indebted Kindness', 'Sidearm', 'There is so little left. And the cost, so high…', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3383958216', 'Harmony-21', 'Submachine Gun', 'SUROS reminds you that a fireteam is better than a soloist.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3383958217', 'Furina-2mg', 'Submachine Gun', 'I am ready to defend my territory.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3383958218', 'Philippis-B', 'Submachine Gun', 'You know these roads.', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3383958219', 'Protostar CSu', 'Submachine Gun', 'What came before?', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3385326721', 'Reckless Oracle', 'Auto Rifle', '"Knowing how it ends isn''t the same as wanting it to be over." —Rekkana, Warlock of the Kentarch 3', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3388655311', 'Tyranny of Heaven', 'Combat Bow', 'It was She that inspired me to imagine your destruction, o jailer mine.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('339163900', 'Nightshade', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Three drops is all it takes.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3393130645', 'Positive Outlook', 'Auto Rifle', 'Lead by example.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('339343290', 'Nergal PR4', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Take arms against the lions of death, the kings of sunset.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('339343291', 'Cadenza-43', 'Pulse Rifle', 'SUROS invites you to improvise.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3393519051', 'Perfect Paradox', 'Shotgun', 'A tale that''s different from the rest: the thread unfurls against the clocks.
The one the Speaker loved the best must have a perfect paradox.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3400256755', 'Zephyr', 'Sword', 'In the cold of winter, we remember that the warm west wind will blow again.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3407395594', 'Smite of Merain (Harrowed)', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Barrel etching: "He parted them like a sea, which closed upon him again."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3409645497', 'Legal Action II', 'Pulse Rifle', 'It''s time to file a complaint.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3410721600', 'Subtle Calamity', 'Combat Bow', 'Quiet but deadly.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3413074534', 'Polaris Lance', 'Scout Rifle', '"I''ve forgotten so much of my past life, of my family. But when I hold this rifle, everything feels right. I feel like… I''m home." —Ana Bray', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3413860062', 'The Chaperone', 'Shotgun', '"My mother had a shotgun we called the Chaperone. Kept us alive out there before we got to the City." —Amanda Holliday', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3413860063', 'Lord of Wolves', 'Shotgun', 'By this right alone do I rule.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3417731926', 'Anamnesis', 'Combat Bow', 'The Valence has dimmed, but the nature of the Echoes grows clearer.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3419149443', 'Crooked Fang-4fr', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'I sink my teeth into my prey.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('342027677', 'Hollow Words', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Holes for the whole.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3421075982', 'Something Something', 'Sniper Rifle', 'It''s got that little, oh, what do you call it again?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3421639790', 'Liminal Vigil (Adept)', 'Sidearm', 'Cause and effect like a looped corridor. I stand. Ever watchful, forever.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3423493037', 'Red Tape', 'Scout Rifle', 'Drink deep of the dead.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3424403076', 'The Fool''s Remedy', 'Sidearm', 'Forged in honor of Nirwen, and the righting of foolish wrongs.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('342514437', 'Rufus''s Fury (Adept)', 'Auto Rifle', '"For every round, a whisper. For every shell, a scream." —Rufus, Acolyte of Nezarec', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3425561386', 'Motion to Compel', 'Scout Rifle', '"Take the long view."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3428407746', 'Lethal Abundance', 'Auto Rifle', 'One can, indeed, have too much of a good thing.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3428521585', 'Insidious', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Shape: Deception', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3431536253', 'Gunburn', 'Submachine Gun', 'Forget your UV protection.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3433930495', 'Gridskipper', 'Pulse Rifle', '"No stars overhead. Best not to look up." —Amanda Holliday', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3434507093', 'Occluded Finality', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Silence is better than unmeaning words.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3434629515', 'Metronome-52', 'Scout Rifle', 'SUROS invites you to keep it steady.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3434944005', 'Point of the Stag', 'Combat Bow', 'Gore befalls those who do not respect the hart.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3435238842', 'Song of Justice VI', 'Scout Rifle', '"Justice must be true, swift, and utterly impartial." —Executor Hideo', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3435238843', 'Good Counsel IX', 'Scout Rifle', '"Surround yourself with wise advisors." —Executor Hideo', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3436626079', 'Exalted Truth', 'Hand Cannon', '"It''s the end of the world. We don''t have another choice." —Ikora Rey', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3437370193', 'Peacebond', 'Sidearm', '"I will honor the terms of this armistice on one condition: the Iron Lords enforce it." —Lord Saladin', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3437746471', 'Crimson', 'Hand Cannon', 'According to official Vanguard policy, this weapon does not exist.', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3438139008', 'Chivalric Fire', 'Sword', 'And this beast evermore Sir Palomides followed, for it was called his quest.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3441197112', 'Nox Cordis II', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Your first enemy is the darkness in your own heart.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3441197113', 'Nox Lumen II', 'Fusion Rifle', 'In darkness, be the light.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3441197115', 'Parsec TSu', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Is it possible to measure the infinite?', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3444632029', 'Unwavering Duty (Adept)', 'Machine Gun', '"There''s no one else I can trust with her care." —Ikora Rey', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3444688218', 'Vision of Confluence', 'Scout Rifle', 'What you have seen will mark you forever.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3445437901', 'Main Ingredient', 'Fusion Rifle', '"Now stir the sauce…"', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3454326177', 'Omniscient Eye', 'Sniper Rifle', '"I have seen too much. No one else should bear these burdens." —Lisbon-13, Hunter of the Kentarch 3', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3460122497', 'Imperial Needle', 'Combat Bow', 'Honor among foes. Glory to the vanquished.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3460576091', 'Duality', 'Shotgun', '"The question becomes whether or not to fire, not where to aim." —Osiris', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('346136302', 'Retold Tale', 'Shotgun', '"It''s what gets left out, what gets reemphasized that you have to pay attention to." —Esila, daughter of Sila', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3461377698', 'Baligant XU7743', 'Shotgun', 'A Black Armory experimental prototype.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3465233192', 'Point of the Stag', 'Combat Bow', 'Gore befalls those who do not respect the hart.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3472875143', 'Wolftone Draw', 'Combat Bow', '"Keep the string a little loose. It''s supposed to sound like that." —Petra Venj', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3473290087', 'Frozen Orbit', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Never out of sight.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('347366834', 'Ace of Spades', 'Hand Cannon', '"Folding was never an option." —Cayde-6', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3481382332', 'King Orfeo', 'Combat Bow', 'A summer rule, yet touched by winter.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3483485727', 'Mistral Lift', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'The unceasing cold without. The glowing hearth within.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3483591058', 'Prosecutor', 'Auto Rifle', '"All this in service of one purpose. You have their attention. Let us see if you can keep it." —Emissary of the Nine', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3485029080', 'Adamantite (Adept)', 'Auto Rifle', '"Inflexibility is its own virtue." —Sloane', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3487253372', 'The Lament', 'Sword', 'The last thing the Vex ever heard—the grinding wails of a vicious Banshee.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3489054606', 'Unwavering Duty', 'Machine Gun', '"There''s no one else I can trust with her care." —Ikora Rey', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3489657138', 'Palmyra-B', 'Rocket Launcher', 'The vengeful get their prize.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3493494807', 'Acasia''s Dejection (Adept)', 'Trace Rifle', 'Do not believe their lies. Run.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3493948734', 'Stampede Mk.32', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Hang on to your helmets!', '953998645', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3493948735', 'Plemusa-B', 'Grenade Launcher', 'You were born for this.', '953998645', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3496887154', 'Phoneutria Fera', 'Hand Cannon', 'Hope you like to wander.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3501969491', 'The Cut and Run', 'Scout Rifle', '"How do you think we got here?" —Avrok, trans. from Eliksni', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3503019618', 'Defiance of Yasmin (Harrowed)', 'Sniper Rifle', 'The impact is too great. Silence falls. The queen was safe… Please… let her be safe.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3503560035', 'Keen Thistle (Adept)', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Your foes will remember your sting.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3504336176', 'Night Watch', 'Scout Rifle', 'Sleep with both eyes open.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3505113722', 'Collective Obligation', 'Pulse Rifle', '"What The Witness gave me, I give to you. May it serve you in death, or in finality. It cannot be both." —Rhulk, disciple of the Witness', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3512014804', 'Lumina', 'Hand Cannon', 'There must be meaning in my roar.', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3512349612', 'Coriolis Force', 'Fusion Rifle', '"A single idea can be enough to alter the spin of entire systems. I''ve had several of them." —Clovis Bray', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3514096004', 'Eternal Blazon', 'Scout Rifle', '"But this eternal blazon must not be to ears of flesh and blood."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3514144928', 'The Summoner (Adept)', 'Auto Rifle', 'Join the dance of fire and birth.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3524313097', 'Eriana''s Vow', 'Hand Cannon', 'A light in the dark.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3524386983', 'Submersion', 'Combat Bow', 'all too familiar, all too different', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3529780349', 'The Marine', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Improvise. Adapt. Overcome.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3535742959', 'Randy''s Throwing Knife', 'Scout Rifle', '"On me, team; I''m capturing the third point!" —Randy, upon receiving orders not to', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3549153978', 'Fighting Lion', 'Grenade Launcher', '"I call it the Zhang Fei. It hits almost as hard as I do." —Wei Ning', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3549153979', 'The Prospector', 'Grenade Launcher', '"Some things should stay buried."', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3550697748', 'Thistle and Yew', 'Scout Rifle', 'Hawthorne forged this weapon out of scraps and salvage during her years alone in the wilds.', '1498876634', '3340296461', 'Common', '2', null), ('3551104348', 'Double-Edged Answer', 'Sword', 'Everything has a cost.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('355382946', 'Coronach-22', 'Auto Rifle', 'SUROS invites you to sing as they fall.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3556730800', 'Psi Aeterna IV', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Alone, unending, peerless.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3556971406', 'Requiem-43', 'Shotgun', 'SUROS invites you to reflect upon the dead.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3556999246', 'Pleiades Corrector', 'Scout Rifle', '"No, I don''t think I''ll tell you what it''s for. That would be too easy." —Lakshmi-2', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3558681245', 'BrayTech Werewolf', 'Auto Rifle', 'The right weapon can transform you.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('355922321', 'Vouchsafe', 'Scout Rifle', '"We knew it would not be easy." —Paladin Hallam Fen', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3559361670', 'The Title', 'Submachine Gun', '"It will take all the best that our best have to offer. The question hangs before us, ready for the grasping: who will claim the title?"  —Commander Zavala', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3561203890', 'Tessellation', 'Fusion Rifle', 'The monolith is hewn; the monument is built.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3565520715', 'Crowd Pleaser', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Give them what they came for.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3568377122', 'Typhon GL5', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Host a launch party with the Typhon GL5 by Omolon.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3569407878', 'Summum Bonum', 'Sword', 'The greatest of all goods.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3569802112', 'The Old Fashioned', 'Hand Cannon', 'This is the way things were.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3569842567', 'Lost and Found', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Hawthorne forged this weapon out of scraps and salvage during her years alone in the wilds.', '1498876634', '3340296461', 'Common', '2', null), ('3573686365', 'Glacioclasm', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Clear and cold, forever.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3574168117', 'Hushed Whisper', 'Combat Bow', 'Quiet now, I''ll do the talking.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3576134513', 'Ribbontail', 'Trace Rifle', 'Beautiful and deadly.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('35794111', 'Temptation''s Hook', 'Sword', 'A finger of death from which to hang.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3580904580', 'Legend of Acrius', 'Shotgun', '"In the Cabal legend, a hero seeks to possess the sun. He succeeds. Then, he becomes Emperor. The Cabal… are not a subtle people." —Tyra Karn', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3580904581', 'Tractor Cannon', 'Shotgun', 'Property of Ishtar Collective. WARNING: Gravity propulsor beam can cause serious injury or even death.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('358190158', 'Drang', 'Sidearm', 'Since the Collapse, these pistols have been retooled several times to boost their firepower. A worn inscription reads, "To Victor, from Sigrun."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3582424018', 'Deadpan Delivery', 'Shotgun', 'Emphasis on the "dead."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3583275737', 'Ros Arago IV', 'Auto Rifle', 'Holding dissimilar concepts in harmony is a mark of wisdom.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('358788212', 'Psi Hermetic V', 'Pulse Rifle', 'No power can be gained by mere exoteric understanding.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3588934839', 'Le Monarque', 'Combat Bow', '"Wings flutter. Beauty distracts. Poison injects. The butterfly''s curse extends to your enemies. A short life, shortened further by your hand." —Ada-1', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3591141932', 'Techeun Force', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Sworn into faithful service to the Queen, the Techeuns of the Reef have long protected the secrets of the Awoken.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3593598010', 'The Time-Worn Spire', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Forged in honor of Silimar, and persistence in the face of impossible odds.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3602242905', 'Stars in Shadow', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Little is known about the early days of the Collapse. Signals vanished upon the arrival of the Darkness.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3605603507', 'Pro Memoria', 'Machine Gun', '"I''m with you, old man. Whether you like it or not."', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3610521673', 'Uzume RR4 (Adept)', 'Sniper Rifle', 'With the Uzume RR4 on your side, the Darkness doesn''t stand a chance.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3612142623', 'Live Fire', 'Scout Rifle', 'It''s not real until it''s life and death.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3612338554', 'Succession', 'Sniper Rifle', 'A single word etched inside the barrel: "Sylvie-1."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3615421669', 'Suspectum-4fr', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'Once my teeth bite, I do not release my prey.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3615748501', 'A Good Shout', 'Combat Bow', 'Thanks for the hot tip.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3616586446', 'First In, Last Out', 'Shotgun', '"I don''t know how it works. You just keep taking damage and keep firing."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3618823368', 'Evening SI4', 'Sidearm', 'Night''s falling. Where are you?', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3620277039', 'Peculiar Charm', 'Submachine Gun', 'You''re one of a kind.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3621336854', 'Accrued Redemption', 'Combat Bow', '"I should never have let it come to this. Now each arrow is a penance." —Lisbon-13, Hunter of the Kentarch 3', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3622137132', 'Last Hope', 'Sidearm', 'Remember what you fight for.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3623686757', 'Hezen Vengeance (Timelost)', 'Rocket Launcher', 'The Hezen Axis Mind is tireless and infinite. Tireless and infinite. Tireless and infinite…', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3624844116', 'Unwavering Duty', 'Machine Gun', '"There''s no one else I 