rained scheme have you got in mind this time?"', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3847137620', 'Sola''s Scar (Adept)', 'Sword', 'Digging leaves a mark.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3849444474', 'Tripwire Canary', 'Combat Bow', '"Luna is in danger." —SOC5 Team Leader', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3849810018', 'Pardon Our Dust', 'Grenade Launcher', 'When the dead speak, you should listen.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3850168899', 'Martyr''s Retribution', 'Grenade Launcher', 'That which returns from the void will always seek revenge.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3851176026', 'Elsie''s Rifle', 'Pulse Rifle', 'The future is built by many hands.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3854037061', 'A Swift Verdict', 'Sidearm', '“Judgment is final.” —Emissary of the Nine', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3854359821', 'The Number', 'Auto Rifle', '"Ah, but which number? Why it and no others?" —Lakshmi-2', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3856705927', 'Hawkmoon', 'Hand Cannon', 'Stalk thy prey and let loose thy talons upon the Darkness.', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3860697508', 'Minuet-42', 'Hand Cannon', 'SUROS invites you to join the dance.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3860697509', 'Pribina-D', 'Hand Cannon', 'Adventure is in your blood.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3860697510', 'Imset HC4', 'Hand Cannon', 'The City''s foes ready themselves for the end.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3861448240', 'Emperor''s Courtesy', 'Shotgun', '"A Reefborn riotgun, rewritten with Hive voices to aid Gahlran the failed. Now yours." —Emperor Calus', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3863882743', 'Uriel''s Gift', 'Auto Rifle', 'Take weapon in hand and fly to victory.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3865728990', 'Father''s Sins', 'Sniper Rifle', 'It doesn''t seem so heavy at first.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3866356643', 'IKELOS_HC_v1.0.1', 'Hand Cannon', 'Subroutine IKELOS: Status=reinitiated.
APOTHEOSIS: Status=active…', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3867373351', 'Axial Lacuna', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Archaeologists understand: a buried hatchet is still, after all, a hatchet.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3868973291', 'Starscape Null', 'Shotgun', 'Entropy''s lesson: one day we''ll all be still.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3870811754', 'Night Terror', 'Sword', '"Become their nightmare." —Eris Morn', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3871226707', 'Mechabre', 'Sniper Rifle', 'The killer robot killer.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3877448149', 'Mirror Imago', 'Submachine Gun', '"I know my duty." —Chalco Yong to Ikora Rey', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3885259140', 'Transfiguration', 'Scout Rifle', 'Desire becomes reality, o wishbringer mine.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3886263130', 'I Am Alive', 'Grenade Launcher', '"When the end comes, I reserve the right to be last." —Calus, Emperor of the Cabal', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3886416794', 'Submission', 'Submachine Gun', 'Shape: Devotion', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3886719505', 'Buried Bloodline', 'Sidearm', 'Shallow graves give way to old vendettas and hungry claims.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3889907763', 'Royal Dispensation II', 'Submachine Gun', '"New Monarchy believes in giving generously, like rain in spring." —Executor Hideo', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3890055324', 'Targeted Redaction', 'Hand Cannon', '"Who?" —Osiris', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3890960908', 'The Guiding Sight', 'Scout Rifle', 'Forged in honor of Efrideet, and all that inspires.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3899270607', 'The Colony', 'Grenade Launcher', 'We outnumber you. We will find you. You are alone, and we are colony.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3904516037', 'Midha''s Reckoning (Harrowed)', 'Fusion Rifle', '"…I will not be forgotten." —Midha, Consort of Stars', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3906357376', 'Madrugada SR2', 'Scout Rifle', 'The dawn is coming.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3906357377', 'Trax Lysis II', 'Scout Rifle', 'You will destroy them one cell at a time.', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3906357378', 'Black Tiger-2sr', 'Scout Rifle', 'I creep unseen through the darkness.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3906357379', 'Armillary PSu', 'Scout Rifle', 'What is the structure of the universe?', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('3906942101', 'Conspirator', 'Scout Rifle', 'Did Ghaul always dream of a republic? What terrible worm burrowed into his heart that he would betray my love and plot against me?', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3907337522', 'Oxygen SR3', 'Scout Rifle', 'Fight on. You''re still breathing.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3909683950', 'Man o'' War', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'Do not enter my realm and expect to leave unscathed.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3915197957', 'Wendigo GL3 (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Turn your hunger outward, never inward.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('392008588', 'Perpetualis', 'Auto Rifle', 'For soldiers of the eternal war.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3920310144', 'Volta Bracket', 'Sniper Rifle', 'The thousandth trigger pull is as smooth as the first.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3920811074', 'Medley-45', 'Auto Rifle', 'SUROS invites you to serve up your greatest hits.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3920882229', 'Exalted Truth (Adept)', 'Hand Cannon', '"It''s the end of the world. We don''t have another choice." —Ikora Rey', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3922217119', 'Lotus-Eater', 'Sidearm', 'Let it all go.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3924212056', 'Loud Lullaby', 'Hand Cannon', '"Let their souls sing along." —Eris Morn', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3926103986', 'Word of Crota (Adept)', 'Hand Cannon', 'There was life, and He spoke unto it; and it was silent, and lived no more.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3926153598', 'Boomslang-4fr', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'T(1/2)', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3926811686', 'Parabellum', 'Submachine Gun', 'Desire peace, prepare for war, endure the irony.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3929685100', 'The Deicide', 'Shotgun', '"Believe in war, and nothing else." —Lakshmi-2', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3937866388', 'Seventh Seraph SI-2', 'Sidearm', 'Kept in holster as the last line. Known for its reliability.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3946054154', 'MIDA Mini-Tool', 'Submachine Gun', 'Select application: Flare gun. Water purifier. Interplanetary Positioning System. Encyclopædia Arcana. Personal flotation device. List continues.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3947966653', 'The Call', 'Sidearm', '"We go together."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3949253499', 'Anamnesis (Adept)', 'Combat Bow', 'The Valence has dimmed, but the nature of the Echoes grows clearer.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3950088638', 'Motion to Suppress', 'Submachine Gun', '"Present your truths carefully."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3951511045', 'Imminence (Adept)', 'Submachine Gun', 'Untether expectation from reality.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3953163559', 'Afterlight (Adept)', 'Fusion Rifle', '"Best part of having been inside the Traveler? I''ve got an argument to win." —Peach the Ghost', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3954531357', 'Mob Justice', 'Submachine Gun', 'Life offers few greater pleasures than to humiliate the venal aristocracy before a crowd. I am father to the people, and they shall adore me above all others.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3957603605', 'Wrong Side of Right', 'Scout Rifle', 'The right thing, for the wrong reasons.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3959549446', 'Yarovit MG4', 'Submachine Gun', 'Death and loss sow the seed of change.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3962575203', 'Hush', 'Combat Bow', '"Breathe. Line up the shot. Enjoy the quiet before the kill." —The Drifter', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3967155859', 'The Last Dance', 'Sidearm', 'Save it for me.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3969066556', 'Midha''s Reckoning', 'Fusion Rifle', '"I see now that everything dies. Even… even memory." —Midha, Consort of Stars', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('396910433', 'Zephyr', 'Sword', 'In the cold of winter, we remember that the warm west wind will blow again.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3969379530', 'Aisha''s Care', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Reassurance. Restraint. A hand on the shoulder, offering both.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3973202132', 'Thorn', 'Hand Cannon', '"To rend one''s enemies is to see them not as equals, but objects—hollow of spirit and meaning." —13th Understanding, 7th Book of Sorrow', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('3977654524', 'Festival Flight', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Light up the sky anew.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3981920134', 'Aureus Neutralizer', 'Hand Cannon', 'You needn''t ask twice.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3984556130', 'Terminus Horizon', 'Machine Gun', 'If something heavy''s coming in, send something heavy back out.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3984776322', 'All or Nothing', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Function: Go all in.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3991544422', 'Sol Pariah 6', 'Submachine Gun', 'Amid the endless death one flew—unnatural all-consuming need—
