Mortal angels mourn the dead while lightless light wraps night in pall.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3993415705', 'The Mountaintop', 'Grenade Launcher', '"In the heat of battle, Guardian, you will know the right choice to make." —Lord Shaxx', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3997086838', 'Rake Angle (Adept)', 'Glaive', 'Sharpness is a product of both tool and wielder.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('3998080529', 'Heliocentric QSc', 'Sidearm', 'What anchors you in the vast cosmos?', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('400096939', 'Outbreak Perfected', 'Pulse Rifle', '~directive = KILL while enemies = PRESENT: execute(directive)~', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4005780578', 'Unexpected Resurgence', 'Glaive', '"Stasis was the thesis. Strand is his dissertation." —Sister Faora', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4009352833', 'Roar of the Bear', 'Rocket Launcher', '"Silimar''s defense broke more assaults than not. His retribution would shake the ground." —Lord Saladin', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4014434381', 'Kibou AR3', 'Auto Rifle', 'It springs eternal.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4017959782', 'Symmetry', 'Scout Rifle', '"Duality is not a curse, but a gift." —Author unknown', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4019651319', 'Festival Flight', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Light up the sky anew.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4019668921', 'Staccato-46', 'Scout Rifle', 'SUROS invites you to shorten their notes.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4020742303', 'Prophet of Doom', 'Shotgun', '"You know how this will end." —Yardarm-4, Titan of the Kentarch 3', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4023807721', 'Shayura''s Wrath (Adept)', 'Submachine Gun', '"But here you are. This is truly a beginning…" —Shin Malphur', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4024037919', 'Origin Story', 'Auto Rifle', 'Your inciting incident is their tragic ending.', '1498876634', '3340296461', 'Common', '2', null), ('4025177550', 'Prosecutor (Adept)', 'Auto Rifle', '"All this in service of one purpose. You have their attention. Let us see if you can keep it." —Emissary of the Nine', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4028298892', 'Psychopomp', 'Grenade Launcher', 'We''ll bring you home.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4036115577', 'Sleeper Simulant', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'Subroutine IKELOS: Status=complete. MIDNIGHT EXIGENT: Status=still in progress.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4037745684', 'Bonechiller', 'Shotgun', '"It seeps under your skin; settles in your bones. Even outside of its presence, you can feel its chill." —The Exo Stranger', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4038592169', 'Forbearance (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Shape: Temperance', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('40394833', 'The Militia''s Birthright', 'Grenade Launcher', '"Earth is our home. Not Mars, not Venus, not even the Reef. We must ensure it is a place we can continue to live for many generations to come." —Devrim Kay', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4039572196', 'The Immortal', 'Submachine Gun', 'Not one, but many.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4041111172', 'The Button', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Jolly. Shiny. Candy-like. Push it.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4043921923', 'The Mountaintop', 'Grenade Launcher', '"In the heat of battle, Guardian, you will know the right choice to make." —Lord Shaxx', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4049127142', 'Returned Memory', 'Sidearm', 'After all this time…', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4050645223', 'Hezen Vengeance', 'Rocket Launcher', 'The Hezen Axis Mind is tireless and infinite. While it cannot be stopped… it can be paused.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4066778670', 'Thin Precipice', 'Sword', 'Sharpened, from tip to hilt, drawing from all who partake in the ritual of war.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4067556514', 'Thoughtless', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Not a thought was given, but a life was taken.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4068264807', 'Monte Carlo', 'Auto Rifle', 'There will always be paths to tread and methods to try. Roll with it.', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4069880346', 'Gizmo Weft', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Now what did this do again?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4070357005', 'Seventh Seraph Carbine', 'Auto Rifle', 'The old workhorse, still with many years to give.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('407150808', 'Ribbontail', 'Trace Rifle', 'Beautiful and deadly.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('407150809', 'Ribbontail', 'Trace Rifle', 'Beautiful and deadly.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('407150810', 'Ribbontail', 'Trace Rifle', 'Beautiful and deadly.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('407150811', 'Ribbontail', 'Trace Rifle', 'Beautiful and deadly.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4074251943', 'Hung Jury SR4 (Adept)', 'Scout Rifle', 'A Scout Rifle, modified by Dead Orbit''s superb technicians and specialists.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('407511664', 'Song of Ir Yût (Adept)', 'Machine Gun', 'It is the song of endings.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('407621213', 'Berenger''s Memory', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Take your place among the company of heroes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4077196130', 'Trust', 'Hand Cannon', '"Worlds end. And when yours does, make sure you have a partner you can rely on." —The Drifter', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4077588826', 'The Palindrome (Adept)', 'Hand Cannon', 'Draw, O Coward!', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4083045006', 'Persuader', 'Sniper Rifle', '"They say you can''t reason with these enemies. I dunno—my gun and I seem to manage just fine." —Kei-Ying', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('408440598', 'True Prophecy', 'Hand Cannon', '"Some claim to know the future better than we do. Listen carefully. Then ask yourself: do their words ring true or false?" —Lakshmi-2', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4090134063', 'Jurisprudent', 'Scout Rifle', 'For every wrong there is a remedy.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4094657108', 'Techeun Force', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Sworn into faithful service to the Queen, the Techeuns of the Reef have long protected the secrets of the Awoken.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4095462486', 'Pit Launcher', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Let everyone fear the gaping maw.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('409551876', 'The Keening', 'Sidearm', '"I heard a Ghost die once, in Twilight Gap. Still hear it sometimes, on dark nights…"', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4095896073', 'Accrued Redemption', 'Combat Bow', '"I should never have let it come to this. Now each arrow is a penance." —Lisbon-13, Hunter of the Kentarch 3', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4096943616', 'Explosive Personality', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Keep your distance from this one.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4097972038', 'A Sudden Death', 'Shotgun', '"Everything dies. This is proof." —Emissary of the Nine', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4100775158', 'Pizzicato-22', 'Submachine Gun', 'Suros asks that you tread firmly.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4103414242', 'Divinity', 'Trace Rifle', 'Calibrate reality. Seek inevitability. Embody divinity.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4104613038', 'Oxygen SR3', 'Scout Rifle', 'Fight on. You''re still breathing.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4105447486', 'Nox Veneris II', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Night comes for us. We are not ready.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4105447487', 'Elatha FR4', 'Fusion Rifle', 'The sun shines on both joy and grief.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4106757302', 'Crowning Duologue', 'Rocket Launcher', 'The stage is yours.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4106983932', 'Elatha FR4', 'Fusion Rifle', 'The sun shines on both joy and grief.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('410996590', 'Jack Queen King 3', 'Hand Cannon', 'An army meets, and stands, and falls. Three nobles wage their hopeless war.
In shifting madness, evil crawls. One stands above the battle''s roar.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('411397829', 'Gunnora''s Axe', 'Shotgun', '"She taught us all to appreciate a good, sturdy axe." —Lord Saladin', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4114929480', 'Snorri FR5', 'Fusion Rifle', 'The latest and greatest in fusion.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4116518582', 'Solemn Remembrance', 'Hand Cannon', '"Time will heal, not erase." —Lord Shaxx', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4116546788', 'Mirror Imago (Adept)', 'Submachine Gun', '"I know my duty." —Chalco Yong to Ikora Rey', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4117693024', 'Mindbender''s Ambition', 'Shotgun', '"Hiraks always did like to leave an impression." —The Spider', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4118334987', 'Mos Athanor IV', 'Hand Cannon', 'Transform yourself.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('412251536', 'Speleologist', 'Machine Gun', '"There is a Human phrase: Many hands make light work." —Eido, Scribe of House Light', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4124357815', 'The Epicurean', 'Fusion Rifle', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4124362340', 'Agape', 'Hand Cannon', 'Boundless, without conditions.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4124984448', 'Hard Light', 'Auto Rifle', 'Ionized polymer synballistic attack platform. The system''s lethality is dynamically robust across tactical spaces.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4129629253', 'Khvostov 7G-0X', 'Auto Rifle', '"You don''t know how long I''ve been looking for you."', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4132072834', 'Locus Locutus', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Speak to remember, speak to forget.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4138174248', 'Go Figure', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Can''t let the Shore get you down.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4138415948', 'Hand in Hand', 'Shotgun', 'This weapon was forged by Devrim Kay VIII for the survivors.', '2465295065', '2395677314', 'Uncommon', '3', null), ('4138415949', 'Ded Acumen II', 'Shotgun', 'Wisdom is the greatest power, the dearest treasure.', '2465295065', '2395677314', 'Uncommon', '3', null), ('4138415950', 'Ded Nemoris II', 'Shotgun', 'You will find your way out of this forest.', '2465295065', '2395677314', 'Uncommon', '3', null), ('413901114', 'Acosmic', 'Grenade Launcher', 'How may we endure the desolation of the absolute?', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('414045521', 'Insurmountable', 'Sidearm', 'Mountains must be devoured one bite at a time.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4145119417', 'Heart of Time', 'Pulse Rifle', '"Perhaps it exists. Perhaps it does not. Either we shall find it, or we shall become it." —Lakshmi-2', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4146673634', 'Outrageous Fortune', 'Grenade Launcher', 'No accounting for where it will fall.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4146673635', 'Theodolite', 'Grenade Launcher', 'The only number that matters is the distance between you and your target.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4146702548', 'Outrageous Fortune', 'Grenade Launcher', 'No accounting for where it will fall.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4148143418', 'Show of Force XF4865', 'Sniper Rifle', 'A Black Armory experimental prototype.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4149758318', 'Traveler''s Judgment 5', 'Sidearm', 'A visitor ignites the sky, and in the truth of light it dreams:
Above the dead and yet-to-die, a legion''s blade with fire screams.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4152016199', 'Better Devils', 'Hand Cannon', 'Angels can''t help you here.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4153087276', 'Appetence', 'Trace Rifle', 'There is the sea. Who can drain it dry?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4156253727', 'The Third Axiom', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Don''t tell me the odds.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4157959956', 'Tongeren-LR3', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Long march. Stone road. Old city. Know the land.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('4157959958', 'Aachen-LR2', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Old kings. Sharp swords. Epic songs. Take the throne.', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('4157959959', 'Damietta-LR2', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Taut sails. Wide rivers. Battered towers. Watch the seas.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('4162642204', 'The Militia''s Birthright (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', '"Earth is our home. Not Mars, not Venus, not even the Reef. We must ensure it is a place we can continue to live for many generations to come." —Devrim Kay', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4164201232', '1000 Yard Stare', 'Sniper Rifle', 'You can see everything. You can unsee nothing.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4166221755', 'Trophy Hunter', 'Sniper Rifle', '"I serve this broken Empire no longer." —Tazaroc', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4169082039', 'Romantic Death', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Both awful and lovely.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4169225313', 'Compass Rose', 'Shotgun', '"Let the Light be your compass." —Mithrax', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('417100299', 'The Guiding Sight', 'Scout Rifle', 'Forged in honor of Efrideet, and all that inspires.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('417164956', 'Jötunn', 'Fusion Rifle', '"Untamed. Destructive. As forceful and chaotic as Ymir himself." —Ada-1', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4173311704', 'Eyes Unveiled (Adept)', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'The show must be seen.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4174431791', 'Hierarchy of Needs', 'Combat Bow', '"I have peered through the eye of Chronos to divine humanity''s path into the future." —Soteria, the Augurmind', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4174481098', 'Steel Sybil Z-14', 'Sword', '"Everything I touch falls apart! I see the fragments on the floor!"

"Well, isn''t that a good thing? You know, if you''re a sword?"', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('417474224', 'Hoosegow', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Cause a stir.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('417474225', 'Mos Epoch III', 'Rocket Launcher', 'The perpetual eventually gives way to the variable.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('417474226', 'Blue Shift', 'Rocket Launcher', 'What is the color of the universe?', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4176551594', 'Qua Vinctus IV', 'Machine Gun', 'You are a fetter for your enemies.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4176873718', 'Fair Judgment', 'Auto Rifle', 'The chair. The blindfold. The scales. The sword.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4184168210', 'Fatebringer', 'Hand Cannon', 'Delivering the inevitable, one pull at a time.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4184808992', 'Adored', 'Sniper Rifle', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Spider''s eclectic tastes.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4190156464', 'Merciless', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Entropy is inevitable.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4190932264', 'Beloved', 'Sniper Rifle', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4193602194', 'No Survivors', 'Submachine Gun', '"There''s not enough seats."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4193877020', 'Does Not Compute', 'Scout Rifle', 'The engineers aren''t ready for us.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4195186942', 'Faith-Keeper', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Never falter, never break.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4200122994', 'Veleda-F', 'Sniper Rifle', 'As predicted.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4203034886', 'Zephyr', 'Sword', 'In the cold of winter, we remember that the warm west wind will blow again.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4207066264', 'Microcosm', 'Trace Rifle', 'We all owe our existence to one singular moment, long ago.', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4207120603', 'False Idols', 'Sword', '"Lay onto me your burdens."', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4209476803', 'Khvostov 7G-02', 'Auto Rifle', 'An ancient instrument of war, battered and worn—but it still fires true. Perhaps it''s been waiting for you.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4211534763', 'Pribina-D', 'Hand Cannon', 'Adventure is in your blood.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4213221671', 'Sunrise GL4', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Do not wait for the sun to rise.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('421573768', 'The Spiteful Fang', 'Combat Bow', 'Pierce the heart of reality.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4219826183', 'Fatebringer (Timelost)', 'Hand Cannon', 'But where is your fate, and who brings it to you?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4220529694', 'Avalanche', 'Machine Gun', 'If they''re close enough to see it start, then they''d better run.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4221591387', 'Abyssal Edge', 'Sword', 'Crease the universe.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4221925398', 'Cup-Bearer SA/2', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Drink deep from the cup of destruction.', '953998645', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('4221925399', 'Reginar-B', 'Rocket Launcher', 'You stand at the head of the army.', '953998645', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('4224667951', 'Heretic''s Fervor', 'Rocket Launcher', 'For some, the Drift never ended.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4225322581', 'Ragnhild-D', 'Shotgun', 'Return fire to sender.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4227181568', 'Exit Strategy', 'Submachine Gun', '"If you don''t got one, it''s time to make one." —The Drifter', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4228149269', 'No Survivors', 'Submachine Gun', '"There''s not enough seats."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4230965989', 'Commemoration', 'Machine Gun', 'A single word is etched inside the barrel: "Clovis-II-1."', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4230993599', 'Steel Sybil Z-14', 'Sword', '"Everything I touch falls apart! I see the fragments on the floor!"

"Well, isn''t that a good thing? You know, if you''re a sword?"', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4232480042', 'VS Pyroelectric Propellant', 'Auto Rifle', 'Archival|Helios|4341| Dr. Saleh, attached see Dr. Bray''s redactions along with guidelines on professionalism. A minor workplace injury is no excuse for personal attacks.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4233375372', 'Marcato-45', 'Machine Gun', 'SUROS invites you to mark time.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('423343404', 'Controlling Vision', 'Sidearm', '"Once you see how the balance is tipped against us—once you see doom coming, inexorable and cold—then you must act." —Arach Jalaal', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('42351395', 'Subzero Salvo', 'Rocket Launcher', '"Our enemies are not subtle, so neither shall we be. Make the chasms echo with the thunder of your artillery." —Clovis Bray', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4238497225', 'D.F.A.', 'Hand Cannon', '"Osiris said that he started to pity the Red Legion, getting trapped in here for infinite eternities. I think they''re getting exactly what they deserve." —Sagira', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4239378215', 'Long Arm (Adept)', 'Scout Rifle', 'Inescapable, from here to the Outer Rim.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('424291879', 'Age-Old Bond', 'Auto Rifle', 'Symbiosis. Not predation. Never predation, o wary one mine.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('42435996', 'Mint Retrograde', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Some things never go out of fashion.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4248569242', 'Heritage', 'Shotgun', 'A single word etched inside the barrel: "Wilhelmina-1."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4248997900', 'Incisor', 'Trace Rifle', 'An infinitely sharp edge to dissect reality.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4249949938', 'Long Arm', 'Scout Rifle', 'Inescapable, from here to the Outer Rim.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4255171531', 'The Hothead', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Think of it as a weaponized temper tantrum.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4255268456', 'Skyburner''s Oath', 'Scout Rifle', 'The inscription, written in a Cabal dialect, reads: "Inexorable victory."', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4255586669', 'Empty Vessel', 'Grenade Launcher', '"It''s versatile. By itself, it''s nothing, just an empty tube. But that''s its deceptive beauty; it''s all about what you fill it with. What you make it. What you make it do." —Banshee-44', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('425681240', 'Acosmic', 'Grenade Launcher', 'How may we endure the desolation of the absolute?', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4265183314', 'Multimach CCX', 'Submachine Gun', 'Friends are as companions on a journey who ought to aid each other to persevere.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4267192886', 'Terminus Horizon (Adept)', 'Machine Gun', 'If something heavy''s coming in, send something heavy back out.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4272442416', 'The Domino', 'Sniper Rifle', '"Who will be the first to fall?" —Lakshmi-2', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4277547616', 'Every Waking Moment', 'Submachine Gun', '"Even my idle thoughts are haunted." —Eris Morn', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('427899681', 'Red Death Reformed', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Vanguard policy still urges Guardians to destroy this weapon on sight.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4281371574', 'Hung Jury SR4', 'Scout Rifle', 'A Scout Rifle, modified by Dead Orbit''s superb technicians and specialists.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4284533075', 'Service of Luzaku', 'Machine Gun', '"This one made it for you. It brings death yet promises nothing beyond." —Luzaku', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('42874240', 'Uzume RR4', 'Sniper Rifle', 'With the Uzume RR4 on your side, the Darkness doesn''t stand a chance.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4287947559', 'Last Man Standing', 'Shotgun', 'Call me Ozymandias.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4288031461', 'The Emperor''s Envy', 'Fusion Rifle', 'The son''s ambition will be his undoing.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4289226715', 'Vex Mythoclast', 'Fusion Rifle', '…a causal loop within the weapon''s mechanism, suggesting that the firing process somehow binds space and time into…', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('4292849692', 'Crimil''s Dagger', 'Hand Cannon', '"She only wanted to help. I know that now." —Lord Saladin', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4293613902', 'Quicksilver Storm', 'Auto Rifle', 'Three words. Carved by hand: Affinity. Altruism. Awareness.', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('431721920', 'Zaouli''s Bane', 'Hand Cannon', '"Go, child! Run! Don''t look back! Don''t—"', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('432476743', 'The Palindrome', 'Hand Cannon', 'Draw, O Coward!', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('432716552', 'Shining Sphere', 'Rocket Launcher', 'Above the cloud with its shadow is the star with its light.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('433905699', 'Swarm of the Raven', 'Grenade Launcher', '"With enough altitude, Felwinter''s destruction would blanket the field farther than you could see." —Lord Saladin', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('435216110', 'Duty Bound', 'Auto Rifle', '"Due respect, Commander? I was there when the Hive found us on Earth. I was there when we stopped them on Titan. And I''ll be there when we wipe them out." —Sloane', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('435821040', 'Darkest Before', 'Pulse Rifle', '"Persevere, or die in darkness. The choice is yours." —Emissary of the Nine', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('435821041', 'Relentless', 'Pulse Rifle', '"Embrace your fate." —Emissary of the Nine', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('437854388', 'Action Item', 'Trace Rifle', 'Don''t hesitate to reach out.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('437854389', 'Action Item', 'Trace Rifle', 'Don''t hesitate to reach out.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('437854390', 'Action Item', 'Trace Rifle', 'Don''t hesitate to reach out.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('437854391', 'Action Item', 'Trace Rifle', 'Don''t hesitate to reach out.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('4425887', 'The Time-Worn Spire', 'Pulse Rifle', 'Forged in honor of Silimar, and persistence in the face of impossible odds.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('444627789', 'Oxygen SR3', 'Scout Rifle', 'Fight on. You''re still breathing.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('445197843', 'Critical Anomaly', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Embrace the chaos, for you are entropy incarnate.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('447296102', 'Truthteller', 'Grenade Launcher', '"If we wish others to accept the grim reality, we must break through every comforting illusion." —Arach Jalaal', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('449318888', 'Deterministic Chaos', 'Machine Gun', '"So all being is a one and only being; and that it continues to be when someone dies, tells you, that he did not cease to be." —Schrodinger''s epitaph', '953998645', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('45643573', 'Raconteur', 'Combat Bow', 'Who doesn''t like to spin a good yarn?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('46125926', 'Dead Messenger', 'Grenade Launcher', 'A gift for the empress who has everything.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('46524085', 'Osteo Striga', 'Submachine Gun', '"Victory is not in the unmaking of an enemy, but in the re-making of an enemy into your blade." —9th Understanding, 7th Revision of Sorrow', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('468276817', 'Nature of the Beast', 'Hand Cannon', 'Don''t let them change you.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('471518543', 'Corrective Measure', 'Machine Gun', 'It breaks the rules of reality as ruthlessly as it shatters your foes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('471764396', 'Pre Astyanax IV', 'Combat Bow', 'The lord of the city grants the blessing of precision.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('472169727', 'Garden Progeny 1', 'Scout Rifle', 'Two siblings cleaved by time and space, reflections never found alone,
The ending of the eldritch race—a path long seen but never known.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('472847207', 'Guiding Star', 'Auto Rifle', '"We will make a new home out among the stars, and then we will know peace. Until that day..." —Arach Jalaal', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('474671201', 'Micromort', 'Rocket Launcher', 'We all get closer every day.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('47772649', 'THE SWARM', 'Machine Gun', 'Hunger is the all of it, and it is all of hunger.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('480368036', 'Tinasha''s Mastery', 'Sidearm', '"We called her Ashraven for her flight, and the ruin she left in her wake." —Lord Saladin', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('48361212', 'Controlling Vision', 'Sidearm', '"Once you see how the balance is tipped against us—once you see doom coming, inexorable and cold—then you must act." —Arach Jalaal', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('48361213', 'Eleventh Hour', 'Sidearm', '"We will save and protect anyone who joins Dead Orbit. There is a place on our ships for you." —Arach Jalaal', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('484515708', 'Rufus''s Fury', 'Auto Rifle', '"For every round, a whisper. For every shell, a scream." —Rufus, Acolyte of Nezarec', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('48643186', 'Ancient Gospel', 'Hand Cannon', '"These forces have existed forever, but only one of them speaks to us." —Rekkana, Warlock of the Kentarch 3', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('487205709', 'Terminus Horizon', 'Machine Gun', 'If something heavy''s coming in, send something heavy back out.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('487361141', 'Gunnora''s Axe', 'Shotgun', '"She taught us all to appreciate a good, sturdy axe." —Lord Saladin', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('491078457', 'Positive Outlook', 'Auto Rifle', 'Lead by example.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('492673102', 'New Pacific Epitaph', 'Grenade Launcher', '"This isn''t happening. This isn''t happening. This isn''t happening."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('495442100', 'Koraxis''s Distress (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', '"I cannot sleep. His gaze… it lingers at every corner of my mind." —Koraxis, Acolyte of Nezarec', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('495940989', 'Avalanche', 'Machine Gun', 'If they''re close enough to see it start, then they''d better run.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('496556698', 'Pre Astyanax IV (Adept)', 'Combat Bow', 'The lord of the city grants the blessing of precision.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('496728945', 'Bold Endings', 'Hand Cannon', 'If you have any say in how you go out—make it bold.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('499245245', 'Ded Gramarye IV', 'Shotgun', 'Satiate wisdom, and be unleashed.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('501329015', 'Chattering Bone', 'Pulse Rifle', 'We have so much to discuss, o seeker mine.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('501345268', 'Shayura''s Wrath (Adept)', 'Submachine Gun', '"But here you are. This is truly a beginning…" —Shin Malphur', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('502356570', 'Drang (Baroque)', 'Sidearm', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('507038823', 'The Last Breath', 'Auto Rifle', '"All things end." —Emissary of the Nine', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('51129316', 'The Inquisitor', 'Shotgun', 'Ask the question.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('515224227', 'First In, Last Out', 'Shotgun', '"I don''t know how it works. You just keep taking damage and keep firing."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('5159537', 'Senuna SI6', 'Sidearm', 'Reliable and steady, the Omolon Senuna SI6 is ready when you need it.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('516243773', 'Beidenhander', 'Submachine Gun', 'Let the song of the monarch be heard!', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('522366885', 'Nessa''s Oblation (Adept)', 'Shotgun', '"His influence doesn''t end at his Fourth Tomb. I will find the rest… by any means necessary." —Nessa, Acolyte of Nezarec', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('525750263', 'Black Scorpion-4sr', 'Scout Rifle', 'I attack from the shadows. I never miss.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('527989828', 'Action Item', 'Trace Rifle', 'Don''t hesitate to reach out.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('528834068', 'BrayTech Werewolf', 'Auto Rifle', 'The right weapon can transform you.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('531591352', 'Forte-15', 'Submachine Gun', 'SUROS invites you to get loud.', '2465295065', '2395677314', 'Uncommon', '3', null), ('531591353', 'Daystar SMG2', 'Submachine Gun', 'A Guardian is a sunrise over darkness.', '2465295065', '2395677314', 'Uncommon', '3', null), ('53159280', 'Traveler''s Chosen', 'Sidearm', 'A City-made sidearm, built for those chosen by the Traveler to become Guardians.', '1498876634', '3340296461', 'Common', '2', null), ('53159281', 'Traveler''s Chosen (Damaged)', 'Sidearm', 'A City-made sidearm, built for those chosen by the Traveler to become Guardians.', '1498876634', '3340296461', 'Common', '2', null), ('532746994', 'Astral Horizon (Adept)', 'Shotgun', 'Even the brightest stars eventually set.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('534775659', 'PLUG ONE.1 (Adept)', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Move with the current.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('535198113', 'Forthcoming Deviance', 'Glaive', 'Prepare yourself. Things get weirder from here on out.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('540880995', 'Dark Decider', 'Auto Rifle', 'The oldest, shortest words—yes and no—are those which require the most thought.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('541053086', 'Telemachus-C', 'Scout Rifle', 'The long wait is over.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('541188001', 'Farewell', 'Sidearm', '"A peace born from violence is no peace at all." —Lady Efrideet', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('542203595', 'Edge of Concurrence', 'Glaive', 'An echo of an ancient weapon, forged from a memory of ambition.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('542573208', 'Last Rite', 'Scout Rifle', 'How will you choose to die?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('547165496', 'Abyssal Edge', 'Sword', 'Crease the universe.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('548809020', 'Exalted Truth', 'Hand Cannon', '"It''s the end of the world. We don''t have another choice." —Ikora Rey', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('548958835', 'Retraced Path', 'Trace Rifle', 'An early prototype that brought the potential for future Trace Rifles into sharper focus.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('55393445', 'The Title', 'Submachine Gun', '"It will take all the best that our best have to offer. The question hangs before us, ready for the grasping: who will claim the title?"  —Commander Zavala', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('555148853', 'Wendigo GL3 (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Turn your hunger outward, never inward.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('557165046', 'Riiswalker', 'Shotgun', '"No. I will not allow a Fallen to fight in the Banner, that right is reserved for Guardians alone. But if you insist, I may allow a Guardian to carry a Fallen-forged weapon into battle. You are a weaponsmith, are you not?" —Lord Saladin to an Unknown Eliksni', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('558794124', 'Cold Denial', 'Pulse Rifle', 'A familiar tool in the face of failure.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('559523765', 'Wilderflight (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', 'The flightless blind, venturing out into the dark. Never to return.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('566740455', 'THE SWARM (Adept)', 'Machine Gun', 'Hunger is the all of it, and it is all of hunger.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('566976652', 'Resonance-42', 'Submachine Gun', 'SUROS invites you to strike a chord.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('566976653', 'Antiope-D', 'Submachine Gun', 'They look to you to save them.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('566976654', 'Phosphorus MG4', 'Submachine Gun', 'The star in the east, the fire in the dawn.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('568515759', 'Chattering Bone', 'Pulse Rifle', 'We have so much to discuss, o seeker mine.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('568611921', 'Forbearance', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Shape: Temperance', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('568611922', 'The Mountaintop', 'Grenade Launcher', '"In the heat of battle, Guardian, you will know the right choice to make." —Lord Shaxx', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('568611923', 'Edge Transit', 'Grenade Launcher', 'What did you trade away to secure passage to the edge?', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('569799273', 'Throne-Cleaver', 'Sword', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('569799274', 'Death''s Razor', 'Sword', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('569799275', 'Goldtusk', 'Sword', 'An Earth artifact, refashioned to suit the Emperor''s modest tastes.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('570866107', 'Succession', 'Sniper Rifle', 'A single word etched inside the barrel: "Sylvie-1."', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('575830664', 'D.F.A.', 'Hand Cannon', '"Osiris said that he started to pity the Red Legion, getting trapped in here for infinite eternities. I think they''re getting exactly what they deserve." —Sagira', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('577528837', 'Contingency Plan', 'Scout Rifle', '"The Traveler is an illusion. A false god. It will not save us. But this might." —Arach Jalaal', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('578105049', 'Oversoul Edict (Adept)', 'Pulse Rifle', 'The light of the will of Crota shines down like a vast and inverse sun.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('578459533', 'Wendigo GL3', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Turn your hunger outward, never inward.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('580961571', 'Loaded Question', 'Fusion Rifle', '"Hey. You see Cayde around, tell him his gun''s ready." —Banshee-44', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('582335600', 'Dire Promise', 'Hand Cannon', '"If you think this world ends well, you are mistaken." —Arach Jalaal', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('586671776', 'Something New', 'Hand Cannon', '"It''s new to me." —Banshee-44', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('591672323', 'Fortunate Star', 'Combat Bow', 'When it shines at dusk, luck will surely come your way.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('593808239', 'Refurbished A499', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Get to higher ground.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('599895591', 'Sojourner''s Tale', 'Shotgun', 'Home is just over the horizon.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('601574723', 'Adamantite (Adept)', 'Auto Rifle', '"Inflexibility is its own virtue." —Sloane', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('601592879', 'Age-Old Bond', 'Auto Rifle', 'Symbiosis. Not predation. Never predation, o wary one mine.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('601948197', 'Zephyr', 'Sword', 'In the cold of winter, we remember that the warm west wind will blow again.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('602331464', 'Micromort', 'Rocket Launcher', 'We all get closer every day.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('602331465', 'Micromort', 'Rocket Launcher', 'We all get closer every day.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('602331466', 'Micromort', 'Rocket Launcher', 'We all get closer every day.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('602331467', 'Micromort', 'Rocket Launcher', 'We all get closer every day.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('602618796', 'Scathelocke', 'Auto Rifle', 'Our eyes squinted, our teeth clenched, our prayers answered.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('603242241', 'Hammerhead', 'Machine Gun', 'Smash through the veil.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('603721696', 'Cryosthesia 77K', 'Sidearm', 'There are things colder than cold.', '1498876634', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('607191995', 'Hollow Words', 'Fusion Rifle', 'Holes for the whole.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('613334176', 'Forbearance', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Shape: Temperance', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('614426548', 'Falling Guillotine', 'Sword', 'What won''t be given must be taken.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('615373993', 'Eyes Unveiled', 'Linear Fusion Rifle', 'The show must be seen.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('616582330', 'Cry Mutiny', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Shares were split anew on the bomb-blacked deck.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('617501162', 'G