', 'Learning a new language isn''t easy.', '2465295065', '2759499571', 'Exotic', '6', null), ('649691506', 'A Good Shout', 'Combat Bow', 'Thanks for the hot tip.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('653875712', 'Ballyhoo Mk.27', 'Hand Cannon', 'Prepare to back up your boasts.', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('653875713', 'Lamia HC2', 'Hand Cannon', 'Make your enemy''s strength your own.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('653875714', 'Azimuth DSu', 'Hand Cannon', 'What lies beyond the horizon?', '1498876634', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('653875715', 'Allegro-34', 'Hand Cannon', 'SUROS invites you to pick up the pace.', '2465295065', '2127292149', 'Rare', '4', null), ('654370424', 'Nation of Beasts', 'Hand Cannon', 'I can show you how we were in our prime. You need only ask, o student mine.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('654608616', 'Revoker', 'Sniper Rifle', 'When they have your back to the wall, when all seems lost—steel yourself! Command your future!', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('655712834', 'The Title', 'Submachine Gun', '"It will take all the best that our best have to offer. The question hangs before us, ready for the grasping: who will claim the title?"  —Commander Zavala', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('65611680', 'The Fool''s Remedy', 'Sidearm', 'Forged in honor of Nirwen, and the righting of foolish wrongs.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('657927352', 'Hullabaloo', 'Grenade Launcher', 'Let''s make some noise.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('664109750', 'Hand in Hand', 'Shotgun', 'This weapon was forged by Devrim Kay VIII for the survivors.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('66875353', 'Avalanche', 'Machine Gun', 'If they''re close enough to see it start, then they''d better run.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('672957262', 'Undercurrent (Adept)', 'Grenade Launcher', 'The river embraces all. Struggle is futile.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('676270382', 'Albruna-D', 'Sniper Rifle', 'Turn back, or suffer defeat.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('679281855', 'Exile''s Curse', 'Fusion Rifle', 'It''s a blessing in disguise.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('681067419', 'Hung Jury SR4 (Adept)', 'Scout Rifle', 'A Scout Rifle, modified by Dead Orbit''s superb technicians and specialists.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('6857689', 'Annual Skate', 'Hand Cannon', '"When the lake used to freeze, people would dance on the ice wearing boots with tiny swords. And fall in love."', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('686951703', 'The Supremacy', 'Sniper Rifle', '"He didn''t recognize me, at the end." —Jolyon Till the Rachis', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('688593230', 'Lance Ephemeral', 'Sniper Rifle', 'One shot and you''re gone.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('689294985', 'Jurassic Green', 'Pulse Rifle', '"''Monster'' is a relative term. Just look at the Drifter."  —Glint', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('689453941', 'The Frigid Jackal', 'Sniper Rifle', 'An ice-cold creature of opportunity.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('690341468', 'Whispering Slab', 'Combat Bow', 'It sings of sorrows that have not yet come to pass.', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('690412397', 'Something Something', 'Sniper Rifle', 'It''s got that little, oh, what do you call it again?', '1498876634', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('690668916', 'Vision of Confluence (Timelost)', 'Scout Rifle', 'In the abyss of time, all the lines converge… upon you.', '2465295065', '4008398120', 'Legendary', '5', null), ('694275488', 'Cynosure', 'Rocket Launcher', 'All eyes on me.', '953998645', '4008398120', 'Legen